// The focused chat's status bar, at the sidebar's foot (frame.flecs hn.SideChat; nothing sits under the composer), no
// plate; its controls chat_bar_h tall, chat_bar_gap apart: on the left den's model and effort picker
// as one quiet control (hn.ChatPick, src/app/chat/pick.rs: the model's name, its effort as a level meter and a small
// chevron, chat_pick_h tall, chat_pick_pad_x in, its chevron chat_pick_chevron across chat_pick_gap after the rest, a
// wash under the pointer); the meter (hn.ChatEffort) chat_effort_lead after the name, chat_effort_h tall, a bar per
// effort chat_effort_bar_w wide, chat_effort_gap apart, chat_effort_bar_radius round, rising from chat_effort_floor of
// its height to all of it. On the right the context meter (hn.ChatContext: a ring chat_ring across, its stroke
// chat_ring_stroke, in a square chat_bar_h across that takes the pointer). While the agent works that one ring breathes
// down to chat_working_breath: the composer's sign of work, not a button (Return sends, Escape stops). After it, how much
// of the person's plan is used (hn.ChatPlan, src/app/chat/plan.rs): chat_plan_lead after the ring, a bar
// chat_plan_meter_w by chat_plan_meter_h, chat_plan_meter_radius round, chat_plan_gap before its words, chat_plan_trail
// of air after them. An aside's card shows its own working ring (hn.ChatWorking: chat_working across, stroke
// chat_working_stroke).
// Everything in the bar is chrome, secondary to the words typed over it: the picker's name at size_chrome in the muted
// ink, and its marks (chevron, level meter, rings) and their hit plates scaled to that size, not to the body's.
// The picker's menu is a ui.SearchMenu (menu_*).
