// The picker's menu (hn.ChatPickMenu): chat_pick_menu_w wide whatever it holds, so a model's line about it wraps under
// the list (chat_pick_detail_*: size, line, insets; always chat_pick_detail_h tall, two lines, so the menu never
// changes height as the highlight moves) instead of being cut; the effort's slider chat_pick_level_t under
// the hairline and chat_pick_level_b over the plate's foot. A sideways two-finger swipe over the control (or the
// slider) steps the effort a stop each chat_pick_swipe_step points the fingers travel (detents: momentum never steps
// it), a pulse on the trackpad at each; the effort is sent chat_pick_commit_secs after the last step (one switch for a
// swipe through several), and the control says the effort in words while it moves and chat_pick_word_secs after.
export const chat_pick_menu_w = 252
