// A chart's series inks (genui chart.rs, `hn.GenTone.series1` on), the dataviz skill's validated categorical palette in its
// fixed order (blue orange aqua yellow magenta green violet red; never cycled, a ninth folds into "other"), each
// appearance its own steps. A transcript is drawn in its ground's scheme (dark unless a Ghostty theme makes it light).
// Checked with validate_palette.js: dark on #121214, worst adjacent CVD dE 8.4, normal-vision 19.3, all >= 3:1; light on
// white, CVD 9.1, normal-vision 19.6, three slots under 3:1 (aqua, yellow, magenta), so a chart always labels its values
// (legend, tips).
