// A badge's ground is opaque and edged (tone_raised, tone_line_strong), so its ink reads over a picture as on the plain
// ground (a Layer over an Image). A toned Badge's plate (den's GenBadge<Tone>) is its state's wash (tone_<state>_wash).
// A Shader's and a Video's box (genui/surface.rs, hn.GenShader and hn.GenVideo): a Shader with no height and no aspect is
// gen_shader_h tall; both are rounded by radius_gen_media on a quiet ground (what shows before the first frame). A video's
// controls ride a dark plate along its foot, gen_video_bar_pad in from its edges, in light inks over the picture whatever
// the appearance (a picture is not the ground: a palette, not a role); its scrub rail is the slider's, thinner.
